### Variables
@API_URL = http://localhost:8080
@USER_TOKEN = {{USER_TOKEN_V2}}
@HUB_TOKEN = {{HUB_TOKEN_V2}}

###
# SETUP: Run 04-auth-v2.http (Register/Login + AssociateHub) first.
# USER_TOKEN_V2 is captured automatically from those responses.
# AssociateHub creates "garden-hub-1" and "greenhouse-hub" by default.
# To see probes listed, run 02-insert-sensor-data.http (or 06-insert-with-v2-hub.http)
# so that at least one sensor_node gets bound to the hub.

###
# ListProbesForHubName - happy path
# Returns all sensor nodes bound to the named hub owned by the authenticated user.
POST {{API_URL}}/garden.v2.GardenService/ListProbesForHubName HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{USER_TOKEN}}

{
  "hub_name": "garden-hub-1"
}

###
# ListProbesForHubName - second hub (should succeed, may return empty list)
# A hub with no data pushes yet will return an empty probes array.
POST {{API_URL}}/garden.v2.GardenService/ListProbesForHubName HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{USER_TOKEN}}

{
  "hub_name": "greenhouse-hub"
}

###
# ListProbesForHubName - hub name not owned by user (should fail: NotFound)
POST {{API_URL}}/garden.v2.GardenService/ListProbesForHubName HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{USER_TOKEN}}

{
  "hub_name": "hub-that-does-not-exist"
}

###
# ListProbesForHubName - empty hub_name (should fail: InvalidArgument)
POST {{API_URL}}/garden.v2.GardenService/ListProbesForHubName HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{USER_TOKEN}}

{
  "hub_name": ""
}

###
# ListProbesForHubName - hub token (should fail: PermissionDenied)
# Only user JWTs are allowed; service-account (hub) tokens are rejected.
POST {{API_URL}}/garden.v2.GardenService/ListProbesForHubName HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{HUB_TOKEN}}

{
  "hub_name": "garden-hub-1"
}

###
# ListProbesForHubName - no auth (should fail: Unauthenticated)
POST {{API_URL}}/garden.v2.GardenService/ListProbesForHubName HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hub_name": "garden-hub-1"
}
